      "rawSource": "(Extracted from full RTF)",
      "cleanSource": "/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [Start] - Do not change */\n\t//this code should be inside the For Each used to load the data\n\t\n\t//Sample conditions to be added manually:\n\t//Where \u003CAttribute\u003E = \u0026DisplayInheritRoles when not \u0026DisplayInheritRoles.IsEmpty()\n\t\n\t\u0026Update = !\u0027\u003Ci class=\u0022fa fa-pen\u0022\u003E\u003C/i\u003E\u0027\n\t\n\t\u0026Delete = !\u0027\u003Ci class=\u0022fa fa-times\u0022\u003E\u003C/i\u003E\u0027\n\t\n\t\u0026BtnMainRole = \u0022WWP_GAM_SetAsMain\u0022\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [End] - Do not change */\n\t\u0026GAMUser.Load(\u0026UserId)\n  \t\u0026GridPageSize = Grid.Rows\n\tIf \u0026DisplayInheritRoles = False\n\t\t\u0026GAMRoles = \u0026GAMUser.GetRoles(\u0026Errors)\n\t\tIf \u0026GAMRoles.Count = 0\n\t\t\t\u0026GridPageCount = 0\n\t\tElse\n\t\t\t\u0026GridPageCount = (\u0026GAMRoles.Count/\u0026GridPageSize) \u002B iif(Mod(\u0026GAMRoles.Count, \u0026GridPageSize) \u003E 0, 1, 0)\n\t\tEndIf\n\t\t\u0026GridRecordCount = \u0026GAMRoles.Count\n\t\tFor \u0026GAMRole in \u0026GAMRoles\n\t\t\t\u0026Name = \u0026GAMRole.Name\n\t\t\t\u0026Delete.Visible = True\n\t\t\tIf \u0026GAMRole.Id = \u0026GAMUser.DefaultRoleId\n\t\t\t\t\u0026BtnMainRole = \u0022\u0022\n\t\t\t\t\u0026Name = \u0026Name \u002B \u0022WWP_GAM_Main\u0022\n\t\t\tElse\n\t\t\t\t\u0026BtnMainRole = \u0022WWP_GAM_SetAsMain\u0022\n\t\t\tEndIf\n\t\t\t\u0026GUID = \u0026Role.GUID\n\t\t\t\u0026Id\t  = \u0026GAMRole.Id\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tGrid.Load()\n\t\tEndFor\n\tElse\n\t\t\u0026GAMRolesDirect = \u0026GAMUser.GetRoles(\u0026Errors)\n\t\t\u0026GAMRoles = \u0026GAMUser.GetAllRoles(\u0026Errors)\n\t\tIf \u0026GAMRolesDirect.Count \u003E 0\n\t\t\t\u0026GridPageCount = (\u0026GAMRoles.Count/\u0026GridPageSize) \u002B iif(Mod(\u0026GAMRoles.Count, \u0026GridPageSize) \u003E 0, 1, 0)\n\t\t\t\u0026GridRecordCount = \u0026GAMRoles.Count\n\t\t\tFor \u0026GAMRole in \u0026GAMRoles\n\t\t\t\t\u0026isDirectRole = False\n\t\t\t\tFor \u0026GAMRoleAux IN \u0026GAMRolesDirect\n\t\t\t\t\tIf \u0026GAMRole.Id = \u0026GAMRoleAux.Id\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0026isDirectRole = True\n\t\t\t\t\t\tExit\n\t\t\t\t\tEndIf\n\t\t\t\tEndFor\n\t\t\t\tIf \u0026isDirectRole\n\t\t\t\t\t\u0026Delete.Visible = false\n\t\t\t\t\tIf \u0026GAMRole.Id = \u0026GAMUser.DefaultRoleId\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0026BtnMainRole = \u0022WWP_GAM_Main\u0022\n\t\t\t\t\tElse\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u0026BtnMainRole = \u0022WWP_GAM_SetAsMain\u0022\n\t\t\t\t\tEndIf\n\t\t\t\tElse\n\t\t\t\t\t\u0026Delete.Visible = False\n\t\t\t\t\t\u0026BtnMainRole.Visible\t= False\n\t\t\t\tEndIf\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\u0026GUID = \u0026Role.GUID\n\t\t\t\t\u0026Id\t  = \u0026GAMRole.Id\n\t\t\t\t\u0026Name = \u0026GAMRole.Name\n\t\t\t\tGrid.Load()\n\t\t\tEndFor\n\t\tEndIf\n\tEndIf"
